{"schema":6,"addons":[{"id":"jid1-MnnxcxisBPnSXQ@jetpack","icons":{"32":"https://addons.mozilla.org/user-media/addon_icons/506/506646-32.png?modified=mcrushed","64":"https://addons.mozilla.org/user-media/addon_icons/506/506646-64.png?modified=mcrushed","128":"https://addons.mozilla.org/user-media/addon_icons/506/506646-128.png?modified=mcrushed"},"name":"Privacy Badger","version":"2026.8.7","sourceURI":"https://addons.mozilla.org/firefox/downloads/file/4944345/privacy_badger17-2026.8.7.xpi","homepageURL":"https://privacybadger.org/","supportURL":"https://privacybadger.org/#faq","amoListingURL":"https://addons.mozilla.org/en-US/firefox/addon/privacy-badger17/","description":"Automatically learns to block hidden trackers. Made by the leading digital rights nonprofit EFF to stop companies from spying on you.","fullDescription":"Privacy Badger automatically learns to block hidden trackers. Privacy Badger is made by the leading digital rights nonprofit EFF to stop companies from spying on you.\n\nPrivacy Badger sends the Global Privacy Control signal to opt you out of data sharing and selling, and the Do Not Track signal to tell companies not to track you. If trackers ignore these signals, Privacy Badger will learn to block them.\n\nBesides automatic tracker blocking, Privacy Badger replaces potentially useful trackers (video players, comments widgets, etc.) with click-to-activate placeholders, and removes outgoing link click tracking on Facebook and Google, with more privacy protections on the way.\n\nTo learn more, see the FAQ on Privacy Badger's homepage.","weeklyDownloads":32077,"type":"extension","creator":{"name":"EFF Technologists","url":"https://addons.mozilla.org/en-US/firefox/user/5474073/"},"developers":[],"screenshots":[{"url":"https://addons.mozilla.org/user-media/previews/full/368/368601.png?modified=1783712481","width":1280,"height":800,"thumbnailURL":"https://addons.mozilla.org/user-media/previews/thumbs/368/368601.jpg?modified=1783712481","thumbnailWidth":533,"thumbnailHeight":333},{"url":"https://addons.mozilla.org/user-media/previews/full/368/368602.png?modified=1783712481","width":1280,"height":800,"thumbnailURL":"https://addons.mozilla.org/user-media/previews/thumbs/368/368602.jpg?modified=1783712481","thumbnailWidth":533,"thumbnailHeight":333},{"url":"https://addons.mozilla.org/user-media/previews/full/368/368603.png?modified=1783712481","width":1280,"height":800,"thumbnailURL":"https://addons.mozilla.org/user-media/previews/thumbs/368/368603.jpg?modified=1783712481","thumbnailWidth":533,"thumbnailHeight":333},{"url":"https://addons.mozilla.org/user-media/previews/full/368/368604.png?modified=1783712481","width":1280,"height":800,"thumbnailURL":"https://addons.mozilla.org/user-media/previews/thumbs/368/368604.jpg?modified=1783712481","thumbnailWidth":533,"thumbnailHeight":333},{"url":"https://addons.mozilla.org/user-media/previews/full/368/368605.png?modified=1783712481","width":1280,"height":800,"thumbnailURL":"https://addons.mozilla.org/user-media/previews/thumbs/368/368605.jpg?modified=1783712481","thumbnailWidth":533,"thumbnailHeight":333},{"url":"https://addons.mozilla.org/user-media/previews/full/368/368606.png?modified=1783712481","width":1280,"height":800,"thumbnailURL":"https://addons.mozilla.org/user-media/previews/thumbs/368/368606.jpg?modified=1783712481","thumbnailWidth":533,"thumbnailHeight":333}],"contributionURL":"https://paypal.me/SupportEFF?utm_content=product-page-contribute&utm_medium=referral&utm_source=addons.mozilla.org","averageRating":4.8096,"reviewCount":613,"reviewURL":"https://addons.mozilla.org/en-US/firefox/addon/privacy-badger17/reviews/","updateDate":1786111295000},{"id":"jid1-NIfFY2CA8fy1tg@jetpack","icons":{"32":"https://addons.mozilla.org/user-media/addon_icons/532/532754-32.png?modified=d96e390b","64":"https://addons.mozilla.org/user-media/addon_icons/532/532754-64.png?modified=d96e390b","128":"https://addons.mozilla.org/user-media/addon_icons/532/532754-128.png?modified=d96e390b"},"name":"AdBlock for Firefox","version":"6.45.0","sourceURI":"https://addons.mozilla.org/firefox/downloads/file/4937830/adblock_for_firefox-6.45.0.xpi","homepageURL":"https://getadblock.com/","supportURL":"https://getadblock.com/","amoListingURL":"https://addons.mozilla.org/en-US/firefox/addon/adblock-for-firefox/","description":"The most popular ad blocker for Chrome and Safari, now available for Firefox! Block all advertisements on all web pages, even Facebook, Youtube, and Hulu. Browse faster, too! Most ads aren't even downloaded at all, saving you time and bandwidth.","fullDescription":"Over 40 million users can't be wrong. AdBlock is the most popular ad blocker for Google Chrome and Safari. Now finally available for Firefox!\n\nSpecial features:\n\n    All ads blocked by default.\n    Block video ads on YouTube.\n    Customize your filter lists.\n    See how many ads you've blocked.\n    Allow ads on your favorite sites in a snap.\n    Available in over 30 languages\n    Speed up your browser. Most ads aren't even downloaded at all.\n    Quick and easy in-page ad reporting.\n\nIt's your browser. What you see should be up to you. AdBlock works automatically, but it only takes a couple clicks to permanently allow ads on any page, or an entire domain. Don't mind text ads? You can easily enable them for Google search results pages. Learn more at the AdBlock website.\n\nOur privacy policy has been updated (Effective Date: May 7, 2018) and is available at https://getadblock.com/privacy/","weeklyDownloads":23240,"type":"extension","creator":{"name":"AdBlock","url":"https://addons.mozilla.org/en-US/firefox/user/10996236/"},"developers":[],"screenshots":[{"url":"https://addons.mozilla.org/user-media/previews/full/261/261849.png?modified=1632941067","width":1280,"height":800,"thumbnailURL":"https://addons.mozilla.org/user-media/previews/thumbs/261/261849.jpg?modified=1632941067","thumbnailWidth":533,"thumbnailHeight":333},{"url":"https://addons.mozilla.org/user-me